usage: zstd-package-benchmark.py [-h] {self-test,prepare,gate,bench} ...

Parent-only isolated full-package qualification and bounded Pi benchmark.
Python >=3.12, standard library only. prepare/self-test never execute package
code. No network, privilege escalation, tuning, package installation or system
writes.

positional arguments:
  {self-test,prepare,gate,bench}
    prepare             host-only copy/extract pinned archives; no package
                        execution
    gate                parent ONLY on exclusive native Pi; five-minute hard
                        budget
    bench               parent ONLY on exclusive native Pi; five-minute hard
                        budget

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
